// Regla Sigma: proc_creation_win_sysinternals_psservice.yml
// ID Sigma: 3371f518-5fe3-4cf6-a14b-2a0ae3fd8a4f
// Título: Sysinternals PsService Execution
// Descripción: Detects usage of Sysinternals PsService which can be abused for service reconnaissance and tampering
// Aplica a: Producto: windows | Categoría: process_creation
// Producto: windows
// Categoría: process_creation
// Servicio: 
// Nivel: medium
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Ruta original: C:\SigmaLab\sigma\rules\windows\process_creation\proc_creation_win_sysinternals_psservice.yml
// Requiere validación en el entorno de destino.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where ProcessVersionInfoOriginalFileName =~ "psservice.exe" or (FolderPath endswith "\\PsService.exe" or FolderPath endswith "\\PsService64.exe" or FolderPath endswith "\\PsService64a.exe")
